; Drawing is XOR. Draw a block, then the same block overlapping it:
; where they overlap, the pixels go dark, and VF says the two met.
; Games find collisions this way, and move a sprite by drawing it
; twice: once to erase it, once in its new place.

A218    ; 200  I := 218             the block, below
6008    ; 202  V0 := 8              x
6108    ; 204  V1 := 8              y
D018    ; 206  draw 8 rows at V0, V1
600C    ; 208  V0 := 12
610C    ; 20A  V1 := 12
D018    ; 20C  draw again: VF := 1, since they overlap
6228    ; 20E  V2 := 40
630C    ; 210  V3 := 12
FF29    ; 212  I := the font's picture of digit VF
D235    ; 214  draw it
1216    ; 216  the end
FFFF    ; 218  the block: eight rows of eight pixels
FFFF
FFFF
FFFF
